cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "RedZeD"
abstract: >-
  An algorithm for computing persistent homology of Vietoris-Rips filtrations,
  based on the Reduction to Zero Differentials framework and its active
  enumeration technique. Includes reference implementations in Julia and C++,
  and the redzed-tda Python package.
type: software
authors:
